#: data/io.github.runexe.RunExe.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"RunExe lets you run Windows software on Linux, such as applications and "
"games. It introduces a workflow that helps you organize by categorizing each "
"software to your liking. RunExe provides several tools and integrations to "
"help you manage and optimize your applications."
msgstr ""
"RunExe lets you run Windows software on Linux, such as applications and "
"games. It introduces a workflow that helps you organize by categorizing each "
"software to your liking. RunExe provides several tools and integrations to "
"help you manage and optimize your applications."

